  "text": "This is the rail. From the top: Home, Inbox, Journal, Calendar, Tasks and the Graph. Hold Command, and each icon shows a number, so Command 1 to 9 jumps straight there. Next to it is the sidebar. Collections holds your notes, each with an icon you choose. Projects lists your task projects. Bookmarks keeps the notes you pin, Canvases holds your whiteboards, and Tags gathers every tag you use. The pen button creates a note in one click, and the arrow beside it opens the create menu, for a note, a journal entry, a task and more.",
